Package: earshot
Title: Speech-to-Text Web App
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: A web application for transcribing audio files using
    'stt.api'. Record from the microphone or upload audio files and get
    transcriptions with timestamps, with live transcription while
    recording. Built on 'glinty', so the only web dependencies are
    'jsonlite' and 'digest'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    glinty (>= 0.0.5),
    jsonlite,
    stt.api,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    audio.whisper,
    pkgload,
    tinytest,
    whisper
